{"id":"647921","name":"寿司","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/647921/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海苔","amount":"3片"}],"sub":[{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"一根"},{"name":"寿司萝卜干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉松","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"寿司萝卜，火腿肠，黄瓜切细丝。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370979349477230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"米饭倒入3盖子寿司醋，搅拌匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370981357281230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"寿司帘放上海苔片，均匀铺米饭，放适量肉松。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370982994663230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入火腿，萝卜，黄瓜。（可以放少些，怕不好卷）","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370984251623230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入沙拉酱。（沙拉酱可以横着挤，上面再盖肉松，方便卷）","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370985485872230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"卷成长方体。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370986756469230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"切片即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/03/21/202303211679370988151932230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}